<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The O5 admin thingy at the bottom! It actually has TWO passwords, but they're really just 'cheat codes' for people coming back for a re-read that want to skip what I call &quot;story mode&quot;.</p>
<p>I advise you only use these passwords after getting to the end naturally:<br />
1. &quot;forgetmenot&quot; will open up the entire UNI list from the start.<br />
2. &quot;iremember&quot; will open the list up AND take you to &quot;UNI-ZERO&quot; which isn't available on the list.</p>
<p>I reiterate: Please don't use them until you've seen it through properly at least once!</p>
<hr />
<p>Next topic: I sort of want this to be a collaborative. You'll notice there's a universe in the list at the end that doesn't appear in the story. That's because this baby can handle universes that don't appear in the story and are just part of the normal universe list. However&#8230; you kind of need to know HTML/CSS to pull it off!</p>
<p>For those that have some web dev skills and are interested, you can Ctrl+F through the code for some sections I've ingeniously labeled &quot;STEP ONE&quot;, &quot;STEP TWO&quot;, and &quot;STEP THREE&quot;. They guide you through the process. Of course, you should probably try adding this article's code to your own sandbox to ensure your attempted integration actually works!</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
